{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level\u2019s objective. Be careful \u2014 over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can clear levels with any number of moves, or carefully plan the best strategy. If you complete a level in the minimum number of moves, you will earn a star. Levels marked EX<strong>\u00a0</strong>have no move requirement\u2014you only need to clear them to earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels take under 10 moves to solve, and none go over 30. Don\u2019t worry about making it too complicated\u2014sometimes it\u2019s just a small trick, other times just skipping a few extra moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639930?t=1757773857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639930/2cd4454a3f0bfd4f8e95d0afd6c18a13d16846ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757773857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639930/2ad161be9a2eb83cd7baabfb036ecd0f6459ff2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757773857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639930/2ad161be9a2eb83cd7baabfb036ecd0f6459ff2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757773857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level\u2019s objective. Be careful \u2014 over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can clear levels with any number of moves, or carefully plan the best strategy. If you complete a level in the minimum number of moves, you will earn a star. Levels marked EX<strong>\u00a0</strong>have no move requirement\u2014you only need to clear them to earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels take under 10 moves to solve, and none go over 30. Don\u2019t worry about making it too complicated\u2014sometimes it\u2019s just a small trick, other times just skipping a few extra moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p>","developers":["Danilliniois"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639930/c0443bbfbf2011a0f52659447d05b702900b9252/header.jpg?t=1757773857","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux (GLIBC 2.28+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196335,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196335/movie480.mp4?t=1757773855","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196335/movie_max.mp4?t=1757773855"},"name":"2048Puzzle","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196335/92ffa401f210790032806c204bb24e6345dd8ac3